1574 0 obj
  << /ActualText (I have been the primary designer on small\054 cross\055functional team focused on key parts of our platform\072 Research Participant app and CE Internal app\056 I collaborated closely on discovery and planning with Product and worked with engineering to size and ship features\056 Major work included \050a full redesign of the participant\055facing app\054 an automated recruiting system\054 and kicked off a community research program to establish a direct feedback loop with our most engaged users\056 Recently\054 I\031ve been exploring opportunities with Claude Code as a prototype builder in local environments and refining design system components\056)
